INT: This was wintertime?

SR: November. November-- deep in snow. But I made it with them. [PAUSES FOR 3 SECONDS]

We stopped at stations. Not going to tell you all the details. You know, we stopped at the first stations. Americans got a hold of us. And they were trying to send us back.

And was a young soldier. And, for some reason or another, my sister said, in Polish, [POLISH]. This means, why should this-- this was like, like you swear at someone, you know?

